  "tinai": "unknown",
  "sangamTamil": "முட்டிகை போல முனியாது வைகலும்\nகொட்டியுண் பாரும் குறடுபோல் கைவிடுவர்\nசுட்டுக்கோல் போல எரியும் புகுவரே\nநட்டார் எனப்படு வார்.",
  "urai": null,
  "english": "Interested and disinterested friends. Even those who, like the artificer's small hammer (with slight strokes fashioning the jewel), gently (முனியாது), day by day, moulding their patron to their will, eat his food, will drop him (when poverty assails him), as the pincers do the gold put into the crucible. Those worthy to be called friends are like the artificer's rod which enters the fire with it.",
